{"resourceIdentifier":"2353","resourceName":"Qingdao Xiaojianxi Phase II MSW landfill site LFG recovery to power project","description":"Qingdao Xiaojianxi Phase II MSW landfill site LFG recovery to power project is located in Hongdao Economic zone, Qingdao City, Shandong Province, P.R. China. The project is invested, constructed and operated by Qingdao Baichang Environmental Technology Co. Ltd. The objective is to collect the landfill gas (LFG) from Qingdao Xiaojianxi MSW landfill site and utilize it to generate electricity.\r\nXiaojianxi landfill site is located in Hongdao Economic zone, Qingdao City, and  started operation in December 2017 with a total design effective capacity of 3,730,000 m3 and a municipal solid waste (MSW) disposal of 3,500 tons/d and an operational lifespan of 4 years. \r\nThe project collects and utilizes LFG from Xiaojianxi landfill site for power generation, which would otherwise be released into the atmosphere. Methane in the LFG has been emitted to the atmosphere since the landfill started operation. Therefore the project avoids methane emissions and, at the same time, electricity is generated from a renewable energy source, instead of being provided by the grid. \r\nThe estimated annual average emission reduction generated by the project over the crediting period is 73,157 tCO2e per year by avoiding the CH4 emissions from the landfill and the CO2 emissions from the fossil fuel power plants in the North China Power Grid (NCPG).","location":{"latitude":36.281399,"longitude":120.157238},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2020-12-04","endExclusive":"2021-01-04","endInclusive":"2021-01-03"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2353"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shandong Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan BCCY Environmental Energy CO.,LTD."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 371 6552 1782"},{"type":"string","value":"lwang@bccynewpower.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2353"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"73157"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"30/04/2021"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 13/04/2019 - 12/04/2029"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=49042&IDKEY=f097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn87m67628918","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Listing Representation-Qingdao.pdf","uploadDate":"2020-10-22T08:58:25.14Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=52399&IDKEY=mlksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098m72258221","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-4.6 clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-04-30T20:03:02.533Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=50729&IDKEY=fiquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfe69955291","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"VCS-Registration-Representation-Qingdao.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-02-02T06:28:18.24Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_Vie